## 2. Codebase map

### Active SPA (do new work here) — ADO `apps/access-requests-portal/web/`

Stack:
- Build: Vite 6 + React 19 + TypeScript (strict, `ES2022`, `jsx: react-jsx`).
- Styling: Tailwind 4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`, with `@theme` tokens and CSS
  variables in `web/src/index.css`. No CSS-in-JS.
- Icons: `lucide-react`. Charts (when added): `recharts`. Animations:
