## 4. Design tokens (source of truth)

### Colors

Surfaces:
- Page: `bg-slate-950`. Light theme override via `:root.light` CSS vars when
  applicable.
- Sidebar / inputs / secondary buttons: `bg-slate-900`.
- Cards: `bg-slate-800/50` (default) or `from-slate-800/80 to-slate-900/80`
  gradient (hero/highlighted cards only).
- Borders: 1px `border-slate-700` (default), `border-slate-800` (subtle
  separators).

Text:
- Headings: `text-white` or `text-slate-200`.
- Body 2°: `text-slate-400`.
- Captions/hints: `text-slate-500` / `text-slate-600`.

Accents:
- **Primary** — `indigo-600` (buttons, primary actions, active nav, refresh).
  Emphasis tints: `indigo-400/500`. Glow: `indigo-600/10` background +
  `indigo-600/20` border. Focus: `outline: 2px solid #6366f1`.
- **Highlight** — `cyan-400` (logo icon, sub-nav active, chart "current"
  series, selected card ring). Backgrounds: `cyan-500/5`–`cyan-500/20`.

Status (soft fill + soft border, paired with icon + label):
- success `emerald-500/10 + emerald-400 + emerald-500/20`
- warning `amber-500/10 + amber-400 + amber-500/20`
- danger  `rose-500/10 + rose-400 + rose-500/20`
- info    `sky-500/10 + sky-400 + sky-500/20`

Catalog env badge (top-right floater):
- PROD = rose, UAT = amber, SIT = sky, LOCAL = slate.

### Typography

- Sans: `Inter` + `ui-sans-serif, system-ui` fallback.
- Mono: `JetBrains Mono` for IDs, log areas and aligned numeric columns.
- Scale (no hero sizes):
  - `h1` → `text-2xl font-bold`
  - `h2` → `text-lg font-semibold`
  - `h3` → `text-sm font-semibold`
  - Body: `text-sm`. Metadata: `text-xs` / `text-[11px]`. Hints: `text-[10px]`.
- Default letter-spacing. Brand title MAY use `bg-clip-text text-transparent`
  over a slate→white gradient. One optional hero KPI per screen MAY use the
  same treatment. Nothing else.

### Radii

- Default `rounded-lg` (8px).
- Cards/panels/modals `rounded-xl` (12px).
- Pills/badges/avatars `rounded-full`.
- **Forbidden:** `rounded-2xl`, `rounded-3xl`.

### Shadows / rings

- Default flat. Use **borders + ring** for separation, not stacked shadows.
- Active/highlighted cards: `ring-2 ring-cyan-500/20` or
  `ring-2 ring-indigo-500/30`.
- `shadow-lg`/`shadow-xl`/`shadow-2xl` allowed **only** on modal dialog
  containers and floating notification/search panels. Never on regular cards
  or hover states.

### Borders

- 1px `border-slate-700` for default separation.
- 1px `border-slate-800` for subtle/secondary separation.
- Status borders follow the soft-fill spec (`{color}-500/20`).

### Spacing

- 4px base (Tailwind default).
- Component padding: cards `p-4`–`p-5`; toolbars `px-3 py-1.5`; form fields
  `space-y-4`; compact rows `py-2` / `py-1.5`.

### Motion

- Transitions: 120–200ms `ease-out` on `color`, `border-color`, `opacity`,
  `background-color`. Full-page state transitions may use `duration-300`.
- Avoid bouncy easings and `transform: scale/translate` on hover.
- Always honor `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`. CSS-only animations
  must guard with this media query.

### Backgrounds

- Body always `bg-slate-950`. Surfaces use slate-900/800.
- No gradients on layout chrome (sidebar, header, buttons).
- Gradients allowed only on: logo halo, brand title text, one optional hero
  KPI card per screen, and chart fills via `<linearGradient>` defs.

