## 5. Chart presets — Recharts on dark canvas

Centralize in `web/src/lib/chart-presets.ts` (export helper components or a
preset object) the first time a chart-touching PR lands. Until then, every new
Recharts usage MUST mirror these props.

```tsx
<CartesianGrid strokeDasharray="3 3" stroke="#334155" vertical={false} />

<XAxis
  dataKey="..."
  tick={{ fill: "#64748b", fontSize: 10 }}
  axisLine={{ stroke: "#334155" }}
  tickLine={false}
/>
<YAxis
  tick={{ fill: "#64748b", fontSize: 10 }}
  axisLine={{ stroke: "#334155" }}
  tickLine={false}
  width={36}
/>

<Bar dataKey="..." fill="#818CF8" radius={[3, 3, 0, 0]} />

<Line
  type="monotone"
  dataKey="..."
  stroke="#06B6D4"
  strokeWidth={2}
  dot={false}
  activeDot={{ r: 3, fill: "#06B6D4" }}
/>

<Area
  type="monotone"
  dataKey="..."
  stroke="#06B6D4"
  strokeWidth={2}
  fill="url(#cyanGradient)"
/>
```

Gradient defs (declare once per chart):

```tsx
<defs>
  <linearGradient id="cyanGradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
    <stop offset="5%"  stopColor="#06B6D4" stopOpacity={0.25} />
    <stop offset="95%" stopColor="#06B6D4" stopOpacity={0} />
  </linearGradient>
  <linearGradient id="indigoGradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
    <stop offset="5%"  stopColor="#818CF8" stopOpacity={0.15} />
    <stop offset="95%" stopColor="#818CF8" stopOpacity={0} />
  </linearGradient>
</defs>
```

Additional chart rules:
- Always wrap in `<ResponsiveContainer>`. Container `min-h-[200px]`.
- Bar/line charts always start at zero (no truncated y-axes for emphasis).
- Annotations on a series: `<ReferenceLine stroke="#F59E0B" strokeWidth={1}
  strokeDasharray="3 3" strokeOpacity={0.5} />`.
- Prefer direct labels on series. `<Legend />` is allowed when there are 3+
  series AND direct labeling is impractical; then `iconType="circle"`,
  `iconSize={8}`, text in `#94a3b8`.
- Pie/Donut: avoid unless strictly required. When unavoidable: direct labels
  and at most 4 slices.
- Tooltip: minimal dark card —
  `bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-[11px]
  shadow-lg`. Number formatting: `Intl.NumberFormat('pt-BR')` for counts. ISO
  or short month for dates.
- No 3D, no shadow on plot area, no decorative gradient fills outside the
  `<linearGradient>` defs above.

